{'symbol': 'CPRT', 'date': '2023-05-31 18:33:00', 'title': 'JROP ANNOUNCES STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP WITH COPART-OWNED CASH FOR CARS', 'text': "DETROIT, MICHIGAN--(NEWSFILE CORP. - MAY 31, 2023) - JROP, AN ON DEMAND ROADSIDE ASSISTANCE PLATFORM, ANNOUNCED IT HAS PARTNERED STRATEGICALLY WITH COPART'S CASHFORCARS.COM TO STREAMLINE ITS JUNK CAR REMOVAL PROCESS. THIS COLLABORATION WILL ENABLE JROP TO SIMPLIFY THE PURCHASING PROCESS FOR JUNK CARS, TRUCKS, AND SUVS ACROSS THE NATION, REGARDLESS OF MAKE, MODEL, OR CONDITION."}